Unified the two ChatGPT importers on Gson (fixes the "two JSON parsers" duplication).

- Deleted the ~180-line hand-rolled JsonParser + JsonValue model from
  ChatGptJsonImporter (423 -> 176 lines); it now parses with Gson.
- Extracted ChatGptMapping (shared, Gson-based): active-branch traversal
  (current_node -> parent chain), role normalization, epoch->ISO timestamps.
  Both importers delegate to it; ChatGptArchiveImporter lost its private copies
  but kept fallbackLeaf, external identity, and unsupported-content counting.
- Behavior preserved (220 tests): active branch when current_node present,
  flat-by-timestamp fallback for tree-less JSON, array -> all conversations.
- One deliberate change: rawJson on loose-.json imports is now Gson-canonical
  (compact) instead of a source substring; two test assertions updated.

